# Mislabel simulation with contamination code for *Deng et al. 2026*

This is the code for running simulations of running the FOMO mislabel
solver on simulated data sets with varying sizes, mislabel rates,
contamination, and other parameters. The code is intended to run on
Mount Sinai's minerva HPC cluster using LSF for batch job management.

These simulations were run while FOMO was still in development, so the
scripts assume that a copy of the FOMO repo has been placed in the
`fomo` subdirectory (they use `devtools::load_all()` on that
directory).
